  "lastAssistantText": "The deliverable is complete and verified.\n\n## Final confirmation\n\n**`index.html`** \u2014 376 lines, single `<script>` block, **zero external resources** (no http/s, no external CSS/JS, no cdn). Fully self-contained and offline-capable.\n\n**All 4 bugs fixed and verified via static analysis + automated simulation:**\n\n| # | Location | Fix | Verified |\n|---|----------|-----|----------|\n| 1 | `startGame()` L298 | `lastTime = 0` \u2192 `performance.now()` | \u2705 loop timing: 2 steps/336ms (was ~24) |\n| 2 | `togglePause()` resume L328 | `lastTime = 0` \u2192 `performance.now()` | \u2705 loop timing: 2 steps/336ms (was ~24) |\n| 3 | keydown `R` L346 | added `e.preventDefault()` | \u2705 present |\n| 4 | `setDir()` L335 | reversal check `dir` \u2192 `nextDir` | \u2705 exploit simulation: reverse now blocked |\n\n**Brief requirements present:** canvas game loop, Arrow+WASD controls, `placeFood` (body-avoiding), scoring with `localStorage` best persistence, wall & self collision (grow-aware tail), Space pause with overlay, R/button restart, increasing difficulty (\u22128ms/level, min 60ms).\n\nJS syntax validated with `node --check`. No further findings through static analysis. The repair is complete.",
